.TH codex-desktop-rollback 1 "May 2026" "codex-desktop 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex-desktop-rollback \- roll back to the previous local Electron desktop release
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codex-desktop-rollback
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B codex-desktop-rollback
swaps the local
.I current
and
.I previous
desktop payload releases for the current user.
.PP
This command is intended as a quick recovery path after a bad local build or
install.
